{
  "id": "E347",
  "title": "Heart of Glass",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-08-04",
  "synopsis": "Why does Little He say that Little Wang has a heart of glass? Is it a compliment?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1114/1844dbfffa1ea44d51ad5c5fcdaa1ead03c39999.mp3?1564388368",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "玻璃心\n\n小张：小王又哭了。\n小何：这个月我也看见了好几次。\n小张：是因为我们老板太严格了吗？\n小何：不是吧。我觉得是她太玻璃心了。她遇到问题特别容易觉得难过。",
    "traditional": "玻璃心\n\n小張：小王又哭了。\n小何：這個月我也看見了好幾次。\n小張：是因為我們老闆太嚴格了嗎？\n小何：不是吧。我覺得是她太玻璃心了。她遇到問題特別容易覺得難過。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Heart of Glass"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：小王又哭了。",
      "traditional": "小張：小王又哭了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xiǎo wáng yòu kū le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Little Wang is crying again."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：这个月我也看见了好几次。",
      "traditional": "小何：這個月我也看見了好幾次。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhè ge yuè wǒ yě kàn jiàn le hǎo jǐ cì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I have also seen it several times this month."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：是因为我们老板太严格了吗？",
      "traditional": "小張：是因為我們老闆太嚴格了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì yīn wèi wǒ men lǎo bǎn tài yán gé le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Is it because our boss is too strict?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：不是吧。我觉得是她太玻璃心了。她遇到问题特别容易觉得难过。",
      "traditional": "小何：不是吧。我覺得是她太玻璃心了。她遇到問題特別容易覺得難過。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé bú shì ba wǒ jué de shì tā tài bō li xīn le tā yù dào wèn tí tè bié róng yì jué de nán guò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Not really. I think she has a “heart of glass”. She very easily feels upset when she runs into problems."
    }
  ],
